.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["1a85c4b6bd565433991f8db27d750f79fe64345270ba2965506fd76a9b4c9806"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [11]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-1-B", "label": "British Academy · Task 1 · Part B", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [4, 5, 6], "questions": [{"number": 25, "prompt": "You hear a discussion between a doctor and nurse about hypoxia and its causes.\n\nWhich of the following conditions arises due to decreased blood flow to the tissues?\n\nA. Hypoxic hypoxia\n\nB. Histotoxic hypoxia\n\nC. Stagnant hypoxia", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 11, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear a discussion between a doctor and nurse about the disease called botulism.\n\nWhich of these may occur due to a cosmetic surgery?\n\nA. Adult intestinal toxemia botulism\n\nB. Iatrogenic botulism\n\nC. Wound botulism", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 11, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear a discussion between a doctor and nurse about gastroesophageal reflux\ndisease.\n\nEsophageal hiatus occurs in which of the following conditions?\n\nA. Esophageal Irritation\n\nB. Hiatal hernia\n\nC. Motility disorder", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 11, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a discussion between a doctor and nurse about congenital myopathy 