ododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "The hemolytic anemia caused due to inadequate hemoglobin is;\n\nA. Sickle Cell Anemia\n\nB. Thalassemia\n\nC. Inherited Hemolytic Anemia", "sourcePage": 9, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 11, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Inherited Hemolytic Anemia is caused due to;\n\nA. Faulty genes\n\nB. Abnormal hemoglobin\n\nC. Abnormal red blood cells", "sourcePage": 9, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 11, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Which of the following is not caused by a defective surface membrane of the red blood cells?\n\nA. Thalassemi\n\nB. Hereditary Elliptocytosis\n\nC. Hereditary Spherocytosis", "sourcePage": 9, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"te